= Wave 3 compiled context =

'''State: Phase 2 — Context compilation + writing.'''

Wave 3 extends the Wave 2 [[Semantics]] foundation into natural-language structure, meaning in use, discourse, lexical meaning, and computational representations of linguistic meaning.

== Dependency order ==

<pre>
Language
 ├→ Syntax
 └→ Semantics [Wave 2]
      ├→ Reference
      ├→ Lexical semantics
      │    ├→ Ambiguity
      │    └→ Polysemy
      └→ Compositionality

Semantics + utterance situation
        ↓
Pragmatics
 ├→ Context (linguistics)
 ├→ Presupposition
 ├→ Implicature
 ├→ Speech act
 └→ Common ground
        ↓
Discourse (linguistics)

Lexical semantics + corpus evidence
        ↓
Distributional semantics
        ↓
Semantic similarity

linguistic content
        ↓ formal / symbolic encoding
